# Checkpoints Dockle should skip. Read from the working directory by Dockle.
# https://github.com/goodwithtech/dockle#ignore-the-specified-checkpoints

# Clear apt-get caches: flagged on the python:3.13-slim base image layer, which
# cleans up with Debian 13's `apt-get dist-clean`, a command Dockle doesn't
# recognize. Our own apt layer in app/Dockerfile removes /var/lib/apt/lists.
DKL-DI-0005
